-- Reading the tables in `Tables.mw`: the crate's `src/lookups.rs`, with binary
-- searches over sorted records in place of its perfect hashes.
--
-- Each table is a string of fixed-width records whose fields are base-64
-- digits, `'0'` standing for 0 up to `'o'` for 63, most significant first.
--
